<body>


<h1>Cleaning Guidelines</h1>

<p>Please follow these guidelines to help make sure your cleaning appointment goes smoothly and that the cleaner has enough space to do their job properly.</p>

<h2>Before Cleaning</h2>

<ul>
    <li>Please make sure that the cleaner have access your room at the scheduled cleaning time.</li>
    <li>Try to tidy up your room before the cleaner arrives so that the cleaning areas are easy to reach.</li>
    <li>Keep personal belongings such as clothes, shoes, bags and other items away from areas that need to be cleaned, no lost item will be held accountable.</li>
    <li>Remove any valuable or important belongings from areas where cleaning will take place.</li>
    <li>Make sure there are no dangerous objects, sharp items or other hazards that could cause an injury.</li>
    <li>If there is a specific area you would like the cleaner to focus on, mention it in the special instructions when making your booking.</li>
    <li>Please make sure your selected room number is correct when submitting your cleaning request.</li>
    <li>Try to be available around the scheduled time in case the cleaner needs to contact you.</li>
</ul>

<h2>During Cleaning</h2>

<ul>
    <li>Please give the cleaner enough space to move around and complete the cleaning safely.</li>
    <li>If you have any specific cleaning requests, communicate them clearly and politely to the cleaner.</li>
    <li>Avoid leaving personal belongings in areas that the cleaner needs to access.</li>
    <li>Please do not interfere with cleaning equipment while the cleaner is working.</li>
    <li>If the cleaner needs clarification about your request, provide the necessary information so the cleaning can be completed correctly.</li>
</ul>

<h2>After Cleaning</h2>

<ul>
    <li>Once the cleaning is complete, check that the areas included in your request have been cleaned properly.</li>
    <li>If you are satisfied with the cleaning, you can leave the room ready for normal use.</li>
    <li>If you notice a problem with the cleaning, report it through the <strong>Report a Problem</strong> section.</li>
    <li>When reporting a problem, provide a clear description of the issue and upload a photo where possible to help explain the problem.</li>
    <li>For questions about your booking or cleaning service, contact residence management for assistance.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Important Reminder</h2>

<p>
    Please remember to treat cleaning staff respectfully and provide accurate information when submitting a cleaning request.
    Following these guidelines helps the cleaning process run smoothly and ensures that both students and cleaning staff have a positive experience.
</p>
</body>

